@startuml sequence-upload-image
' Sequence Diagram Upload Image - PIXEL-T
' Alur diverifikasi dari NewAnalysis.tsx, services/analysis.ts,
' backend/app/routes/analysis.py, dan AnalysisService.

title Sequence Diagram Upload Image - PIXEL-T

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceParticipant underline false
skinparam roundcorner 5

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #DCE9F7
  BorderColor #2E5E9E
  FontColor #172B4D
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #2E5E9E
  FontColor #172B4D
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #DCE9F7
  BorderColor #2E5E9E
  FontColor #172B4D
}
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2E5E9E
  LifeLineBorderColor #2E5E9E
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #EEF5FC
  GroupBorderColor #2E5E9E
  GroupBackgroundColor #EEF5FC
  GroupHeaderFontColor #172B4D
  DividerBackgroundColor #DCE9F7
  DividerBorderColor #2E5E9E
  DividerFontColor #172B4D
}

actor "Pengguna" as Pengguna
participant "Upload Image\n(React + API Client)" as Upload
participant "Supabase Auth" as SupabaseAuth
participant "Flask API\n(/api/analysis)" as Flask
participant "AnalysisService" as AnalysisService
participant "Supabase Storage" as Storage
database "Supabase Database" as Database
participant "AnalysisJobQueue" as JobQueue

Pengguna -> Upload: Membuka halaman dan memilih gambar
Upload -> Upload: Validasi ekstensi, MIME type,\nukuran, nama, dan gambar dapat dibaca

break File tidak valid
  Upload --> Pengguna: Menampilkan pesan validasi
end

Upload --> Pengguna: Menampilkan preview gambar
Pengguna -> Upload: Menekan tombol Start Analysis
Upload -> SupabaseAuth: getSession()

break Sesi atau access token tidak tersedia
  SupabaseAuth --> Upload: Sesi tidak tersedia
  Upload --> Pengguna: Meminta pengguna masuk kembali
end

SupabaseAuth --> Upload: Session dengan access token
Upload -> Flask: POST /api/analysis\nmultipart image + Bearer token
Flask -> SupabaseAuth: get_user(access token)

break Token tetap tidak valid (HTTP 401)
  SupabaseAuth --> Flask: Token tidak valid
  Flask --> Upload: HTTP 401 Unauthorized
  Upload --> Pengguna: Menampilkan pesan sesi berakhir
end

SupabaseAuth --> Flask: User terautentikasi
Flask -> AnalysisService: create_analysis(file, user_id)
AnalysisService -> AnalysisService: Validasi file, format, ukuran,\nintegritas, dan dimensi gambar

break Validasi backend gagal
  AnalysisService --> Flask: Error validasi (HTTP 400)
  Flask --> Upload: Respons gagal
  Upload --> Pengguna: Menampilkan pesan kesalahan
end

AnalysisService -> Storage: Upload gambar asli\nke bucket privat

break Upload Storage gagal
  Storage --> AnalysisService: Error penyimpanan
  AnalysisService --> Flask: Error Storage (HTTP 500)
  Flask --> Upload: Respons gagal
  Upload --> Pengguna: Menampilkan pesan kesalahan
end

Storage --> AnalysisService: Upload berhasil
AnalysisService -> Database: Membuat record analisis\nstatus = processing

break Pembuatan record gagal
  Database --> AnalysisService: Error database
  AnalysisService -> Storage: Menghapus gambar asli\n(kompensasi)
  AnalysisService --> Flask: Error database (HTTP 500)
  Flask --> Upload: Respons gagal
  Upload --> Pengguna: Menampilkan pesan kesalahan
end

Database --> AnalysisService: Record analisis dibuat
AnalysisService -> JobQueue: try_enqueue(analysis job)

break Antrean penuh
  JobQueue --> AnalysisService: Pekerjaan ditolak
  AnalysisService -> Database: Menghapus record analisis
  AnalysisService -> Storage: Menghapus gambar asli
  AnalysisService --> Flask: QUEUE_FULL (HTTP 429)
  Flask --> Upload: Respons antrean penuh
  Upload --> Pengguna: Menampilkan pesan antrean penuh
end

JobQueue --> AnalysisService: Pekerjaan diterima
AnalysisService --> Flask: { analysis_id,\nstatus: processing }
Flask --> Upload: HTTP 202 Accepted
Upload --> Pengguna: Menampilkan status unggahan diterima

note right of Upload
  Jika request menerima HTTP 401,
  API client memperbarui sesi lalu
  mencoba ulang request satu kali.
  Cabang 401 menunjukkan retry yang
  tetap ditolak.
end note

note over Flask,JobQueue
  HTTP 202 berarti gambar tersimpan dan pekerjaan diterima antrean,
  bukan berarti analisis AI telah selesai.
  Proses AI dan pemantauan status dijelaskan pada diagram terpisah.
end note

@enduml
